# TEST FIXTURE (id 228): the encounters on OPEN ground (contract section 63). Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make roam`, section `open`).
# column = i, row = j. A meadow with every kind of tile the open-ground roll must tell apart: plain grass `.` and the path `=` (OPEN ground: no collision flag at all; rate 64/256 here), the tall grass `g` (its own
# rate 25), the pond `w` (its own water table, 60: surfing only), a ledge row `v`, a step trigger `X`, arrow floors `>` and a bike slope `s` (all flagged: never an open-ground roll), a door `D` (a warp).
# No @roam: the statistics of the host test must not meet a roamer.
@map test_open
@size 24 16
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill grass
@spawn start 12 13 N
@surf yes
@encounters grass rate=25
  flitter 3 6 60
  muncrit 3 6 40
@end
@encounters water rate=60
  jabbird 10 12 70
  lunelle 11 13 30
@end
@open_rate 64
@legend
  .  tile=grass
  =  tile=path
  g  tile=tall_grass
  w  tile=sea_o
  B  object=bush
  v  ledge=SW
  X  tile=grass interact=step script=noop
  >  tile=arrow_se
  s  tile=slope_s
  D  tile=path
@grid
  BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
  B......................B
  B.====================.B
  B......................B
  B..ggggg.....wwwwww....B
  B..ggggg.....wwwwww....B
  B..ggggg.....wwwwww....B
  B......................B
  B..vvvvvv..............B
  B......................B
  B..XX..>>>>.....ssss...B
  B......................B
  B....D.................B
  B......................B
  B......................B
  BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
@warp D -> ruta_1 spawn=south oneway
@script noop step
    end
@end
